{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff9f5;--accent:#ff7aa2;--muted:#6b6b6b;--card:#fffbf9;--glass: rgba(255,122,162,0.06);--radius:14px}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;line-height:1.45;color:#222;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);}
    header{padding:28px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ffd27a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:#333;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    .hero{padding:48px 20px 28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center;}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(20,20,20,0.04)}
    h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 6px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;padding:20px}
    .bio p{margin-top:0}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,122,162,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
    .aside{position:relative}
    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}
    footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* small screens */
    @media(min-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 380px}.two{grid-template-columns:1fr 380px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class='brand'>
      <div class='logo'>S</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
      <a href='about.html'>About</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Ways I Help</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>My Approach</a>
      <a href='fees.html'>Fees</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class='hero'>
      <div class='panel'>
        <div class='pill'>Licensed Therapist — Confidential Sessions</div>
        <h1>Hi — I'm a clinician focused on thoughtful, grounded work.</h1>
        <p class='lead'>I work with people who want clearer footing when life rearranges itself. Sessions blend curiosity, clinical training, and practical tools you can use between appointments.</p>

        <div style='margin-top:16px'>
          <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <div class='meta'>Phone: {{PHONE}} • Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class='aside panel'>
        <svg class='pattern' viewBox='0 0 200 200' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice' aria-hidden='true'>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
              <stop offset='0' stop-color='#ff7aa2'/>
              <stop offset='1' stop-color='#ffd27a'/>
            </linearGradient>
            <pattern id='p1' width='20' height='20' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>
              <rect width='20' height='20' fill='transparent'></rect>
              <circle cx='4' cy='4' r='2' fill='url(#g1)' />
              <circle cx='16' cy='16' r='2' fill='url(#g1)' />
            </pattern>
          </defs>
          <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#p1)'></rect>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>A bit about my practice</h3>
          <p class='meta'>I hold a private practice focused on short-term and ongoing options that are individualized to what feels useful for you. My work is informed by evidence-based approaches and adapted to the particular story you bring.</p>

          <h4 style='margin-bottom:8px;margin-top:12px'>Context</h4>
          <p class='meta'>Sessions are collaborative — we set aims together, try adjustments when something isn't helping, and take time to reflect on progress. I provide a supportive clinical relationship, not medical advice or emergency services.</p>

          <div style='margin-top:12px'>
            <strong>Confidentiality & limits</strong>
            <p class='meta'>Conversations are confidential within legal and ethical limits. I will discuss confidentiality in our first session. If there is imminent risk of harm, I must follow mandated reporting and emergency procedures.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class='two'>
      <div class='panel bio'>
        <h3>My background</h3>
        <p>I am a licensed therapist with training in multiple therapeutic models. My clinical work focuses on helping people navigate transitions, reduce unhelpful patterns, and strengthen how they relate to themselves and others.</p>

        <h4>How I work</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Short focused work for specific decisions or transitions</li>
          <li>Longer-term collaboration when deeper exploration is useful</li>
          <li>Practical tools—skill-building, communication practice, and reflection between sessions</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 style='margin-top:12px'>Ethics & scope</h4>
        <p class='meta'>I do not provide psychiatric prescribing. I can coordinate with other providers when medication or additional care is part of the plan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class='panel'>
        <h4 style='margin-top:0'>Next steps</h4>
        <p class='meta'>If you'd like to explore working together, the easiest step is a brief consult where we can see if there's a fit and plan a first session.</p>
        <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>

        <div style='margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>
          <div>Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          <div style='margin-top:8px'><strong>Important note:</strong> If you are in immediate danger or require urgent help, please call local emergency services or your country's crisis line. This site is not for crisis response.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style='max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'>
      <div style='margin-bottom:6px'>© <span id='year'></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <div class='meta'>Care offered in-person and via secure telehealth where available. Sessions are subject to standard practice policies discussed at intake.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
